(see LICENSE in this directory, copied verbatim from ESPHome).

Modifications in this copy:
  - buffer fragmentation: the framebuffer is split into N horizontal strips
    and the display lambda is re-run once per strip, so a 240x240 panel fits
    in ESP8266 RAM
  - INVON (inversion on) for this panel
  - a TCP stream server that blits RGB565/RGB332 tiles pushed from a PC
